      "text": "you must ask me if it be right, D&C 9:8. they are not right before me, D&C 49:2. hold … this right and this inheritance in the church, until he transgresses, D&C 51:4. until he reigns whose right it is to reign, D&C 58:22. firstborn holds the right of the presidency over this priesthood, D&C 68:17. No man has a legal right to this office, D&C 68:18 (107:76). many things that are not right in your house, D&C 93:43. law … maintaining rights and privileges, D&C 98:5. it is not right that any man should be in bondage one to another, D&C 101:79. Melchizedek Priesthood holds the right of presidency, D&C 107:8. Presidency of the High Priesthood … have a right to officiate in all the offices, D&C 107:9. High priests … have a right to officiate in their own standing, D&C 107:10. priesthood, which she, Zion, has a right to by lineage, D&C 113:8. shall not have right to the priesthood, D&C 121:21. because he loveth that which is right, D&C 124:15. secure to each individual … the right and control of property, D&C 134:2. all governments have a right to enact such laws, D&C 134:5.",
